干渉しあうことで、それぞれの内面へと影響を与えていく。過去に囚われた彼女達の物語が今、動き出す。","tagline":"世界に刃向かう、６つの果実"}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xTOu2hSoGZi0rx9f5JOXbEkFSu3.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xTOu2hSoGZi0rx9f5JOXbEkFSu3.png","language":"en","width":800,"height":279},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8Wyl9T1N6O79kJoVYKuCJzdXjhR.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8Wyl9T1N6O79kJoVYKuCJzdXjhR.png","language":"en","width":1000,"height":562},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9eC0IRqkjd3m8Llj9M9fFGgZZtv.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9eC0IRqkjd3m8Llj9M9fFGgZZtv.png","language":"en","width":800,"height":252},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xkzl3OMfANDrqVbmeAmPVy9qAAv.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xkzl3OMfANDrqVbmeAmPVy9qAAv.png","language":"en","width":1000,"height":562},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/poBXhLqtqaapXYrHVp0epsWHlN2.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/poBXhLqtqaapXYrHVp0epsWHlN2.png","language":"ja","width":981,"height":554},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jjcS29vopaQx72c0scQjJqcZWmW.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jjcS29vopaQx72c0scQjJqcZWmW.png","language":"ja","width":687,"height":290},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xM8Km4igaA9C4R7n2Wlj5zQ9AF8.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xM8Km4igaA9C4R7n2Wlj5zQ9AF8.png","language":"ja","width":993,"height":557},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8NcRdP0XI5vi4aG8KLQpIsRLTlT.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8NcRdP0XI5vi4aG8KLQpIsRLTlT.png","language":"ja","width":507,"height":205}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pzkneUGKQ6gW0Rgh43Olj6ibIcQ.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pzkneUGKQ6gW0Rgh43Olj6ibIcQ.jpg","language":"en","widt